Package: pgplsim
Title: Penalized Generalized Partially Linear Single-Index Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Yoon Bae",
        "Jun",
        email = "junpeea@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Implements penalized generalized partially linear single-index
    models for regression with potentially correlated predictors. The framework
    combines a flexible nonparametric single-index component, represented using
    penalized B-splines, with a separate linear component for covariate
    adjustment. This formulation represents nonlinear joint predictor effects
    through a low-dimensional index while retaining interpretable linear
    effects for additional covariates. The package supports generalized
    response distributions and provides functions for model fitting,
    prediction, and inference.
